  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo a los Servicios Humanos en Guyana</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Human Services in Guyana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de esta operacin y de la serie programtica es aumentar la eficiencia y la calidad de la proteccin social para la poblacin vulnerable de Guyana. Esta operacin es la primera de una serie de dos prstamos programticos basados en polticas (PBP).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation and the programmatic series is to increase the efficiency and quality of social protection for the vulnerable population in Guyana. This operation is the first in a series of two programmatic policy-based loans (PBPs).</narrative>
  </description>
